{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project: Null Hypothesis</strong> is an immersive horror game where you relive the last moments of the life of Elias Weber, a researcher at Lear Company who disappeared into the Backrooms.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181720/extras/52dc52488cce52ffeafd6970919d8aa0.avif?t=1772401487\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will play as Elias found recordings, exploring the anomalous space with him. Uncover the sinister secrets of the Backrooms as you wander through endless corridors and frighteningly familiar rooms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181720/extras/e8b01bbf19c7a2a941527cc680a7332c.avif?t=1772401487\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>His notes are the key to the solution. Immerse yourself in his nightmare, relive his last day in the Backrooms, and uncover the dark truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181720/extras/d5ce67c411a2412dc3ccfc14a6cfb66b.avif?t=1772401487\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you uncover what happened to Elis before he met an unknown fate?</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181720/extras/83cc0ee7fb3c01ccc6f1e009b8752c3d.poster.avif?t=1772401487\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181720/extras/83cc0ee7fb3c01ccc6f1e009b8752c3d.webm?t=1772401487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=